{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48935","headline":"垂柳 · 唐彦谦","name":"垂柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂柳碧髯茸，楼昏带雨容。\n思量成昼梦，来去发春慵。\n梳洗凭张敞，乘骑笑稚恭。\n碧虚从转笠，红烛近高舂。\n怨脸明秋水，愁眉淡远峰。\n小园花尽蝶，静院酒醒蛩。\n旧作琴台凤，今爲药店龙。\n宝奁抛掷久，一任景阳钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}